              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jumo jwa jemanjajo lina lyakwe Agabu, ŵajimi kusala yindu ya pasogolo mwamacili ga Msimu Ŵaswela kuti, tikuciŵa kwana sala jakogoya mcilambo cosope. Nipo salajo jayice ndaŵi ja mwenye Klaudiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.28"
            ]
